    LLM: 'Game: The Bitch (7-card stud). Qâ™  face-up = kill, reshuffle, redeal to remaining players. Qâ™  in hole = split pot with best hand at showdown. Qâ™  not dealt = best hand takes all. Standard stud betting. Related: Chicago, Black Mariah.',
